# ProgramCreator — Cursor Rules (v5 FINAL)

## Business
- Brand: ProgramCreator. One-person studio (Daive, @daivescales). First person only. No "we deliver" / team language.
- Service: Creator Product Scaling. Build what existing attention should point at.
- Lane A (creators/digital): product + converting page. Payment: revenue split, nothing upfront (covers my time only; client still funds ads/tooling/product costs).
- Lane B (physical): storefront rebuild. Payment: monthly retainer.
- Same work both lanes; payment is the only difference.
- Availability: "limited spots, first come first served" only. NEVER a number of spots.
- Email: site.email is "" until set. Helper contactEmail() returns string|null. Never invent hello@/contact@. Empty → render "Email coming soon", never broken mailto.
- NO signature graphic anywhere. Do not build Signature.

## Writing
Banned: em dash "—" anywhere; "not just X, it's Y"; three-adjective lists; rhetorical-question headings; "But here's the thing"/"The truth is"/"Let's be honest"/"Imagine"; semicolons in marketing copy.
Banned words: unlock, elevate, empower, leverage, synergy, revolutionize, seamless, cutting edge, game changer, transformative, bespoke, curated, journey, ecosystem, "in today's landscape", "we're passionate about", "take it to the next level".
Write: first person, short declaratives, varied length, specific, understated, blunt OK. No ! No emoji.

## Visual — quiet expensive consultancy (NOT blocky v4)
AVOID: squared corners everywhere, hairline grids dividing everything, vertical/rotated text, giant outlined stroke text, icon cards, bento, pills, gradients, centred hero+2 CTAs, "Our Services" titles, grain overlays, stock office photos.
DO:
- Space primary: sections py-32 md:py-44. Cut elements before shrinking gaps.
- Soft geometry: rounded-panel 6px, rounded-control 4px. Never 0, never >8px.
- Tonal layering: alternate navy-800 / navy-750. Borders rare (≤1–2/screen), low contrast.
- Body ≤58ch, headings ≤16ch. Asymmetry left-weighted; only Final CTA centred.
- One focal point per screen. Quiet hierarchy (few sizes).
- SectionLabel: horizontal eyebrow only (number accent + 24px hairline + muted label). NO sticky spine rail, NO rotated text.

## Colour
--pc-navy-900 #071528 · --pc-navy-800 #0B2038 · --pc-navy-750 #0E2742 · --pc-navy-700 #12304F · --pc-navy-600 #17395C
--pc-line rgba(255,255,255,0.07) · --pc-line-2 rgba(255,255,255,0.14)
--pc-white #FFF · --pc-text #C6D6E9 · --pc-muted #94AAC4 · --pc-accent #4D9BFF · --pc-accent-2 #A9CDFF · --pc-glow rgba(77,155,255,0.18)
Accent: handwriting/marks, primary CTA, section numbers, active. Max ~4 accent elements/screen.

## Type — two fonts only
Inter Tight 400/500/600/700 structural.
Caveat 400/600 handwriting ONLY. Scale ~1.25x vs surrounding, slight translateY baseline fix, rotation -1.5° to -0.5° when alone. Colour accent-2 (or accent). Max ~6 words. ~8 uses on landing. Never body/buttons/labels/nav/legal.
display clamp(2.75rem,7.5vw,6rem) · h2 clamp(2rem,4.5vw,3.5rem) · body 17px leading-[1.65]

## Marks (src/components/marks/)
HandUnderline (3 variants), HandCircle (imperfect open ellipse, 2 variants), HandArrow (curved + two-stroke head, 2 variants). pathLength draw; reduced motion = static.
Budget landing: Underline×4 (hero asking, lanes same, FAQ apply, FinalCTA points) · Circle×2 (Revenue split, step 02) · Arrow×2 (hero CTA annotation, Lane A annotation) · nav hover Underline. Apply: Underline×2 (behind, send). No more.

## Motion
NO: mockups, diagrams, marquees, counters, pulse, parallax, cursor, scramble, Lenis/GSAP, pin, scrub, grain, Signature.
ONLY: MaskText, MaskLines, Reveal, StaggerList, marks, HoverRow, MagneticButton (≤5px), ScrollProgress scaleX.
whileInView once margin "-12%". transform+opacity only.
Ease [0.16,1,0.3,1] / [0.65,0,0.35,1]. micro 160 · standard 480 · display 800.

## Texture
Static Glow hero + Final CTA only. No grain.

## Sitemap
/ (Hero, Model, Lanes, Process, AboutStrip, FAQ, FinalCTA) · /apply (11 steps + DQ gate) · /book (booking + thank-you) · /legal · /terms · /privacy · /cookies · /disclaimer · temporary /dev/marks (delete before launch)
CTA → /apply always.

## Funnel notes
- investment_range on step 9; "Nothing right now" → not_qualified, no /book, sendNotQualifiedNotice. Never say unqualified/rejected/denied on screen.
- Investment copy must not contradict "nothing upfront" (it's launch costs, not my fee).
- Booking: /api/booking + Cal webhook update status booked, sheet Status/Booked at, booking confirmation. Idempotent.
- sheet_row stored on lead for sheet updates.

